<p>Your mind is so powerful it can bend reality, providing you with an extra-natural <span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">storage</span></span> for bodies you snatch.</p><p>You can store up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 7, 9, 11</acronym> bodies.</p>